    <string name="offline_auto_cellular">Also on 4G / 5G</string>
    <string name="offline_auto_cellular_hint">Uses fast mobile data (not roaming), about 15 to 30 MB per refresh.</string>
    <string name="offline_auto_footer">As soon as the network is good (Wi-Fi, or 4G/5G if ticked), the app downloads the map around you and the next 30 km of your track ahead of time, then renews it as you ride. You keep a readable map even without network. The last three areas are kept.</string>
